WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.141 --> 00:00:01.265
- You guys paying attention?
- What?

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:04.686
SCOTT LANG
I don't believe you.

00:00:04.737 --> 00:00:05.815
CASSIE LANG
Let's just show him.

00:00:06.633 --> 00:00:07.650
- Alright.
- Okay.

00:00:07.701 --> 00:00:10.598
KATHRYN NEWTON
[Gasps] Oh my God! Oh my gosh!

00:00:10.648 --> 00:00:12.154
SCOTT LANG
Wait, you have a suit?

00:00:13.859 --> 00:00:15.354
KATHRYN NEWTON
Oop! Sorry.

00:00:15.405 --> 00:00:18.205
EVANGELINE LILLY
She was very excited. So cool.

00:00:18.255 --> 00:00:18.918
PAUL RUDD
These are really good!

00:00:18.969 --> 00:00:19.949
JONATHAN MAJORS
Hey, buddy!

00:00:22.279 --> 00:00:24.493
PAUL RUDD
I think they really captured our likenesses.

00:00:24.544 --> 00:00:26.154
KATHRYN NEWTON
That looks so much like you, that's crazy!

00:00:26.205 --> 00:00:27.401
JONATHAN MAJORS
This is really, really, really cool.

00:00:27.451 --> 00:00:29.707
I mean, there he is.
With the hand!

00:00:30.209 --> 00:00:32.129
KANG THE CONQUEROR
You're out of your league, Ant-Man.

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:32.998
PAUL RUDD
Let's go!

00:00:33.049 --> 00:00:33.631
EVANGELINE LILLY
Yes!

00:00:33.682 --> 00:00:34.343
PAUL RUDD
Yeah!

00:00:37.918 --> 00:00:39.104
PAUL RUDD
Kaw! Kaw! Kaw! Kaw!

00:00:39.155 --> 00:00:40.183
KANG THE CONQUEROR
You thought you could win.

00:00:41.001 --> 00:00:41.833
- Iyk!
- Ah!

00:00:46.813 --> 00:00:47.648
PAUL RUDD
That's awesome!

00:00:47.699 --> 00:00:48.875
SCOTT LANG
Word of advice...

00:00:49.805 --> 00:00:51.364
Look out for the little guy.

